ikewise $0, but partnership status itself is then an open legal question gating formation. OPEN: Properties balance-sheet line items imply capital +$1,380,000 vs stated $(380,000), unreconciled $1,760,000 not forced to balance; no tax rate applied to at-risk gain (no rate authority in library)."
}

